WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.994 --> 00:00:20.866
Sign in as the business owner.

2
00:00:20.966 --> 00:00:26.332
Purchasing starts with suppliers: the people and companies you buy your stock from.

3
00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.661
Click New supplier to add one.

4
00:00:29.761 --> 00:00:35.296
Enter the supplier name and a contact person. A name is all that is required.

5
00:00:35.396 --> 00:00:39.606
Add a phone number and an email so you know how to reach them.

6
00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:46.457
The address goes on your purchase orders, so fill in the street, city and country.

7
00:00:46.557 --> 00:00:50.547
Click Save supplier. It now appears in your supplier list.

8
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:59.392
A purchase order is your request to a supplier. Open Purchase Orders and click New Purchase Order.

9
00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:05.136
Choose the supplier and the branch the goods are delivered to.

10
00:01:05.236 --> 00:01:13.621
Click Add Item, pick a product, then enter the quantity and what the supplier charges per unit.

11
00:01:15.414 --> 00:01:20.339
The total is worked out for you. Click Save to create the order as a draft.

12
00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:27.887
When you are ready to send it, click Mark as Ordered. The supplier is emailed the order.

13
00:01:32.921 --> 00:01:37.352
The status changes to Ordered and a Receive Stock section appears.

14
00:01:37.453 --> 00:01:44.084
When the delivery arrives, enter how many units came in. Receive all remaining fills in the full quantity.

15
00:01:45.586 --> 00:01:50.626
Click Receive Stock. The quantity is added to your inventory for that branch.

16
00:01:52.728 --> 00:01:58.259
The order now shows what was received, and the receiving history records the delivery.

17
00:02:00.068 --> 00:02:07.582
Open Inventory, then Stock levels, and search for the product.

18
00:02:07.682 --> 00:02:12.772
Basmati Rice 1 kg went from 0 to 40 in stock, and its status is no longer Out.

19
00:02:12.872 --> 00:02:19.933
That is the buying cycle: supplier, purchase order, receive, stock. Reorder Suggestions can start orders for you.
